  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.<br>• Thinly slice red radish.<br>• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and roughly chop. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f847fb4264524ca9791338/step-dedcce00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to cover the base over medium-high heat with. </p> <p>• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken, until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.</p> <p>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p> <p>TIP: Cook in batches if your pan is crowded. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f847fb4264524ca9791338/step-be6e3c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine cucumber, radish, avocado, deluxe <br>salad mix and a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season with salt and <br>pepper to taste.<br>• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second <br>bursts until warmed through. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f847fb4264524ca9791338/step-22e0c120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice chick’n.<br>• Spread tortilla bases with some of the smokey aioli.<br>• Fill each tortilla with cucumber salad and crunchy chick’n.<br>• Drizzle tacos with remaining smokey aioli to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f847fb4264524ca9791338/step-1816df30.jpg"
    }
  ]
